	-- The owner's calls of 2026-11-03, step O3: each Dire Maul quest in the wing where it is done, so East's page names Capital Gardens for the lorekeepers and Falrin (North's keeps "inside Dire Maul"), West's names Gordok Commons for Captain Kromcrush, and notes say where the rest is (the ogres, Telmius's remains) (2026-11-03; drafted, to be checked)
	["Lorekeeper Lydros, inside Dire Maul: Capital Gardens"] = "Wissenshüter Lydros, in Düsterbruch: Hauptstadtgärten",
	["Lorekeeper Kildrath, inside Dire Maul: Capital Gardens"] = "Wissenshüter Kildrath, in Düsterbruch: Hauptstadtgärten",
