	-- Quests added on 2026-11-03 (the owner's calls on which quests and chains belong): Furen's Armor and Brutal Hauberk on Razorfen Kraul, Mana Surges and Celestial Power on Uldaman, the Alliance's Seeking the Kor Gem on Blackfathom Deeps, Saving the Best for Last on Upper Blackrock Spire and Scholomance after Back to the Beginning, and the lead-ins to Gahz'rilla, Researching the Corruption and Underground Assault as rows; The Test of Righteousness's Blackfathom note without Thundris (2026-11-03; drafted, to be checked)
